    "description": {
      "value": "You fill the creature's mind with a terrifying vision. The target must attempt a Will save. A creature frightened by this spell takes 1 additional mental damage each time it's hit by a Strike.\n\n- **Critical Success:** The target is unaffected.\n- **Success:** The target is frightened 1.\n- **Failure:** The target is frightened 2. If it's asleep, it wakes up and is paralyzed for 1 round.\n- **Critical Failure:** As failure, but frightened 3."
    },
